        {
            "content_html": "<img src=\"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/432915?v=4\" width=\"64\" height=\"64\" alt=\"\"/><br/><p dir=\"auto\">wip</p>",
            "url": "https://github.com/mdn/content/pull/42338",
            "title": "Add passkeys guide",
            "date_modified": "2025-12-10T04:27:20.000Z",
            "date_published": "2025-12-10T04:25:44.000Z",
            "author": {
                "name": "wbamberg",
                "url": "https://github.com/wbamberg"
            }
        },
        {
            "content_html": "<img src=\"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/161916643?u=ac460ddbb1c07a3453efc41c8bbb87d21b4878a5&v=4\" width=\"64\" height=\"64\" alt=\"\"/><br/><p dir=\"auto\">The current documentation states that all keydown events count as user activation except the Esc key and browser-reserved shortcut keys.<br>\nHowever, in practice, several additional keys do not trigger user activation in major browsers (Chrome, Firefox), such as CapsLock, NumLock, and other lock/system keys.</p>\n<p dir=\"auto\">This update clarifies that user activation is not triggered by certain non-character or system keys, making the documentation more accurate and aligned with real browser behavior.</p>\n<a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" href=\"https://private-user-images.githubusercontent.com/161916643/524629710-6e25b448-e531-4f77-85ad-78fac0f4a6f7.png?jwt=eyJ0eXAiOiJKV1QiLCJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiJ9.eyJpc3MiOiJnaXRodWIuY29tIiwiYXVkIjoicmF3LmdpdGh1YnVzZXJjb250ZW50LmNvbSIsImtleSI6ImtleTUiLCJleHAiOjE3NjUzNDMyNDcsIm5iZiI6MTc2NTM0Mjk0NywicGF0aCI6Ii8xNjE5MTY2NDMvNTI0NjI5NzEwLTZlMjViNDQ4LWU1MzEtNGY3Ny04NWFkLTc4ZmFjMGY0YTZmNy5wbmc_.viOvDDZBkIdwd6mapyj_aNNesgCJZpOJRUCzTK97ge4\"><img width=\"728\" height=\"113\" alt=\"image\" src=\"https://private-user-images.githubusercontent.com/161916643/524629710-6e25b448-e531-4f77-85ad-78fac0f4a6f7.png?jwt=eyJ0eXAiOiJKV1QiLCJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiJ9.eyJpc3MiOiJnaXRodWIuY29tIiwiYXVkIjoicmF3LmdpdGh1YnVzZXJjb250ZW50LmNvbSIsImtleSI6ImtleTUiLCJleHAiOjE3NjUzNDMyNDcsIm5iZiI6MTc2NTM0Mjk0NywicGF0aCI6Ii8xNjE5MTY2NDMvNTI0NjI5NzEwLTZlMjViNDQ4LWU1MzEtNGY3Ny04NWFkLTc4ZmFjMGY0YTZmNy5wbmc_.viOvDDZBkIdwd6mapyj_aNNesgCJZpOJRUCzTK97ge4\" style=\"max-width: 100%; height: auto; max-height: 113px;\"></a>",
            "url": "https://github.com/mdn/content/pull/42337",
            "title": "There are more keydowns that don't constitute user activation #41393",
            "date_modified": "2025-12-10T04:03:22.000Z",
            "date_published": "2025-12-10T04:02:55.000Z",
            "author": {
                "name": "Abhi-Sharma",
                "url": "https://github.com/Abhi-Sharma"
