        {
            "content_html": "<img src=\"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/23019147?u=4c0de81596ced64dc067dea5686f7ca2912db0cb&v=4\" width=\"64\" height=\"64\" alt=\"\"/><br/><h3 dir=\"auto\">Description</h3>\n<p dir=\"auto\">I'm breaking up the updates by directory to make reviews easier, starting with <code class=\"notranslate\">web/css</code>.</p>\n<p dir=\"auto\">Used VS Code Search and Replace to update links:</p>\n<ul dir=\"auto\">\n<li>\n<p dir=\"auto\">Simple links</p>\n<p dir=\"auto\"><strong>Search pattern</strong>: <code class=\"notranslate\">\\[`([^`]+?)`\\]\\(/en-US/docs/Web/CSS/Reference/Properties/\\1\\)</code><br>\n<strong>Replace</strong>: <code class=\"notranslate\">{{cssxref(\"$1\")}}</code></p>\n<p dir=\"auto\">This replaces <code class=\"notranslate\">[`animation-range`](/en-US/docs/Web/CSS/Reference/Properties/animation-range)</code> with <code class=\"notranslate\">{{cssxref(\"animation-range\")}}</code>.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p dir=\"auto\">Links with anchor and custom text</p>\n<p dir=\"auto\"><strong>Search pattern</strong>: <code class=\"notranslate\">\\[`([^`]+?)`\\]\\(/en-US/docs/Web/CSS/Reference/Properties/([^#)]+?)(#[^)]+?)\\)</code><br>\n<strong>Replace</strong>: <code class=\"notranslate\">{{cssxref(\"$2\", \"$1\", \"$3\")}}</code></p>\n<p dir=\"auto\">For example, this replaces:<br>\n<code class=\"notranslate\">[`display: contents`](/en-US/docs/Web/CSS/Reference/Properties/display#display_contents)</code><br>\nwith<br>\n<code class=\"notranslate\">{{cssxref(\"display\", \"display: contents\", \"#display_contents\")}}</code></p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p dir=\"auto\">Links with custom text (no anchor)</p>\n<p dir=\"auto\"><strong>Search pattern</strong>: <code class=\"notranslate\">\\[`([^`]+?)`\\]\\(/en-US/docs/Web/CSS/Reference/Properties/([^#)]+?)\\)</code><br>\n<strong>Replace</strong>: <code class=\"notranslate\">{{cssxref(\"$2\", \"$1\"}}</code></p>\n<p dir=\"auto\">For example, this replaces:<br>\n<code class=\"notranslate\">[`display: grid`](/en-US/docs/Web/CSS/Reference/Properties/display)</code><br>\nwith<br>\n<code class=\"notranslate\">{{cssxref(\"display\", \"display: grid\")}}</code></p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h3 dir=\"auto\">Additional details</h3>\n<p dir=\"auto\">The <a href=\"https://github.com/mdn/rari/blob/d215f3e97fa7dcc48cd627221092c185fd41b2b3/crates/rari-doc/src/templ/templs/links/cssxref.rs#L46C1-L50C2\"><code class=\"notranslate\">cssxref</code> macro</a> accepts three parameters:</p>\n<div class=\"snippet-clipboard-content notranslate position-relative overflow-auto\" data-snippet-clipboard-copy-content=\"pub fn cssxref(\n    name: String,\n    display: Option&lt;String&gt;,\n    anchor: Option&lt;String&gt;,\n)\"><pre class=\"notranslate\"><code class=\"notranslate\">pub fn cssxref(\n    name: String,\n    display: Option&lt;String&gt;,\n    anchor: Option&lt;String&gt;,\n)\n</code></pre></div>",
