        {
            "content_html": "<img src=\"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/148754?v=4\" width=\"64\" height=\"64\" alt=\"\"/><br/>\n\n<h3 dir=\"auto\">Description</h3>\n<p dir=\"auto\">The unicode explanation originally in this document was moved to the <code class=\"notranslate\">Window.btoa()</code> document but this note was not updated, leaving a confusing reference to \"the next section\" which was now missing.</p>\n\n<h3 dir=\"auto\">Motivation</h3>\n<p dir=\"auto\">Help readers find the mentioned but now relocated content.</p>\n\n<h3 dir=\"auto\">Additional details</h3>\n<p dir=\"auto\">Problem introduced in commit <a class=\"commit-link\" data-hovercard-type=\"commit\" data-hovercard-url=\"https://github.com/mdn/content/commit/087a73e18e2818c1cc6b9955218c614c44e612a0/hovercard\" href=\"https://github.com/mdn/content/commit/087a73e18e2818c1cc6b9955218c614c44e612a0\"><tt>087a73e</tt></a></p>\n\n<h3 dir=\"auto\">Related issues and pull requests</h3>\n\n\n\n",
